        <p>have been universally admitted to be A BOON TO: WOMANKIND. They are the best known remedy for Anwmia, Giddiness Fulness and Swelling after Meals, Loss of Appetite, Hysteria. Palpitation of the Heart, Debility, Depression, Weakness, Irregularities and all Female Ailments. Boxo, 92-(1., Is. fld.. 25. 9d and 45. 6d. May be had from Chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors everywhere. Do not be persuad to accept a substitute. If not in stock ask ed them to obtain them, or to be had direct from the Pro- prietor— DB. DAVIS. 309, Portobello-road, Notting Hill. London.</p>
        <p>LADIES. LADIES. M, RS. SCFIAFFER-BENNYON, the Fiminent Lady -13-1 L Specialist In all Female COmolatnts, has much pleasure in announcing that her REMEDY for restoring regularity WITHOUT MEDICINE is the only positive, sate, certain, and speedy one known. It acts almost imme- diately and does not interfere with household duties. Guaran- teed harmless. fiend at once stamped addressed envelope for full par- ticulars and most convincing Testimonials (GtrinArtTFED GENUINE UNDER A PENALTY OF £1,000). to MBS. it:CHAFFER EIMON, 63, High Holborn, London, W.O.</p>
