        <p>WARRINGTON, TUESDAY SUNE 20TH, BLUE COAT SCHOOL FIELD.</p>
        <p>THE £LOOO,OOO SHOWMEN.</p>
        <p>LORD JOHN SANGER &amp; SONS, LIMITED. 'GREAT BRITAIN'S LARGEST AND GRANDEST AMUSEMENT INSTITUTION. THE LARGEST AND GRANDEST SHOW IN THE WORLD. Founded In 1837 by JOHN SANGER (THE ELDEST and ORIGINAL SANGER).</p>
        <p>THE ONLY TRAVELLING ESTABLISHMENT THAT HAS BEEN COMMANDED BY HER MAJESTY THE QUEEN TO APPEAR AT WINDSOR CASTLE. The FIRST VISIT OF LORD JOHN SANGER AND SONS', LTD., AN AIGANAIEDENGLISR SHOW. SCOTCH, IRISH. and FRENCH TOURING COMPANIES, forming without doubt the most Stupendous and Colossal Exhibition ever presented in England.</p>
        <p>£IO,COO CHALLENGE to any show eitant to produce a procession equal in riches, a perfornumee as novel, excellen and varied; and a stud of 300 horses and ponies as perfect In condition. More Horses, more Elephants. more Lions, mor Animals of every &amp;seriph( n, more Freaks, more Performers. More Novelties than any other travelling exhibition, an forms the Greatest, the ( remise, the moEt Gigantic arid Pest Exhibition new before tbe plearxre-seeking public. Lad Clowns, Lady Ringmaster, Lady Object Holders, Elephant Clowns, Talking Clowns, Tumbling Clowns, and Singin 'Clowns.</p>
        <p>THE GREATEST NOVELTY IN THE WORLD! THE ELEPHANTS versus CLOWNS FOOTBALL MATCH. FOOTBALL MATCH, ELEPHANT v. MAN. Fora'very MASSIVE GOBLET, which will be onsview at the GRAND CLOTHING HALL CO.. BRIDGE-STREET. BATE. Captain Warrington Football Club has arranged to compete against SANGER'S CENTRE FORWARD ELEPHANT. vfhislreawkiek the moat goals cut of five tries, 1. 'BATE and the ELEPHANT to keep goal in turn.</p>
        <p>GREAT NEW BRITISH OLYMPIA AND HIPPODROME Champion Racing Tournaments. Glorious Feats ,eames, and sports. Great Hippodrome Events. Daring Races. Contest and Trials. Roman Races. Chariot Races High School Equestrianism and Manege Exhibitions.</p>
        <p>A MIGHTY MAGNIFICENT FREE PROCESSION will be given daily in each town at One o'clock. The Return of Cleopatra. Tremendous exhibition of Opulence and Riches. Dick Marsh, the Famous English Whip, will drive the longest team of horses ever driven by one man. Cages of Wild Beasts (with trainers inside). Birds and every description of Animals will be shown. This magnificent Sight will be found the Grandest ever organised by LORD JOHN bANGER &amp; BONS. LIMITED, THE GREATEST BNITISH SHOWMEN, and free to everybody. A delightful and instructive gift to - the children of rich and poor, and worth coming miles to see. Note the day and date of arrival of THE GREAL BRITISH SHOW, which will be conveyed from town to town in its own SIXTY SPECIALLY CONSTRUCTED ROAD CARS built at Sangers' Works. Bremar-road, South Tottenham, London. LORD JOHN SANGER &amp; Sons, Ltd., have determined that the English Entertainment presented this season shall surpass anything previously attempted, and will be. found to be worth ten times the amount paid for admission. 6d.. Is., 25., and 3s. No extra charge—One ticket admits to all, and all seats may be tak9a in advance. Half-price under ten to is.. 25., and 3s. Seats only. Two Performances Daily, at 2-30 j and '7-30. Frequent and convenient trains from and to all parts of the district. N.B.—No connection with George Sanger, and the First visit of these Amalgamated Shows in your town.</p>
