        <p>PIES. They'are a luxury.—Advt. Old Established, Honest Dealers, SCALES AND SONS, 83, Bridge-street Warri ug ton.—A.dvt. CYCLNIS.—Special Ladies and Gents Machines at £7 15s See Windows. J. 8. GARLAND, Bridge-at., Warrington.</p>
